  "decision_conditions": [
    "Consent is refused for the following works: T1 (Ash) - fell to as close to ground level as possible.\r\n\r\nThe proposed felling of the protected Ash tree is not considered justified as the tree is only exhibiting early signs of Ash Dieback, remains of significant amenity value and does not currently present an unacceptable risk to public safety. The Council considers that the tree can be retained and monitored, with any deadwood removed under the relevant exemptions, and that the loss of the tree would be detrimental to the character and appearance of the area."
  ]
